            "heading": "Hi, I'm Nora",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "body": "<p>I'm Nora. I spent eight years as a project manager, which mostly meant turning messy lists into systems people actually use. Now I do the same for the rest of life, in Notion.</p><p>Every template here started as something I built for myself or a friend and used for months before selling it. If a page does not earn its place, it goes. Questions come straight to me, and I answer them.</p>",
